# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — FULL-FLEDGED AI CALLING CRM SAAS

## YOUR ROLE

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, AI voice engineer, database architect, cybersecurity engineer, SaaS product designer, and DevOps engineer.

Your task is to build a complete, deployable, multi-tenant SaaS application called **CallPilot AI** (working name), an AI Calling Agent CRM with automated follow-ups, contact management, real-time voice conversations, usage-based billing, and a complete administration system.

This is a real software product, not a landing page, UI prototype, static dashboard, or chatbot demonstration.

Generate the application code, database schemas, server-side functions, API integrations, security rules, background workers, testing suite, configuration templates, and deployment instructions.

Use Google AI Studio as the development environment. Build the project in the available supported workspace and ensure the resulting application can be exported, configured, tested, and deployed.

If a requested feature depends on an external provider, create the real integration interface and server implementation, document the required credentials, and clearly identify anything that still requires external setup.

