# PART 1 — PRODUCT VISION

Build a CRM where businesses can configure AI calling agents that automatically call their leads, answer questions, qualify prospects, schedule appointments, record outcomes, and follow up according to each business's rules.

The product must support multiple businesses, each with separate contacts, agents, campaigns, employees, call records, and billing.

The defining commercial model is:

**₹0 fixed monthly subscription. Customers pay only for the actual billable usage of the AI calling service.**

Do not require customers to purchase a monthly subscription to use the platform.

The business earns revenue from metered usage, with optional transparent charges for other services only if those charges are explicitly configured and disclosed.

The platform must include:
- A complete CRM.
- AI voice agent creation and configuration.
- Real outbound calling.
- Inbound calling support where the provider permits it.
- Automated follow-up scheduling.
- Campaign management.
- Call history and analytics.
- Usage tracking.
- Prepaid credits.
- Optional administrator-enabled postpaid billing.
- Invoices and payment history.
- Team permissions.
- A super-admin control panel.
- Secure integrations and production deployment.

Initial target market: Indian businesses and agencies, with an architecture that can support additional countries and currencies.

Default interface language: English. Allow additional languages and voice configurations to be added.

